            <ArticleTitle>Toward All Room-Temperature, Solution-Processed, High-Performance Planar Perovskite Solar Cells: A New Scheme of Pyridine-Promoted Perovskite Formation.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1002/adma.201604695</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A new, all room-temperature solution process is developed to fabricate efficient, low-cost, and stable perovskite solar cells (PVSCs). The PVSCs show high efficiency of 17.10% and 14.19%, with no hysteresis on rigid and flexible substrates, respectively, which are the best efficiencies reported to date for PVSCs fabricated by room-temperature solution-processed techniques. The flexible PVSCs show a remarkable power-per-weight of 23.26 W g-1 .</AbstractText>
